      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hacksider/Deep-Live-Cam/tarball/2.7-beta",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hacksider/Deep-Live-Cam/zipball/2.7-beta",
      "body": "This is the beta version of 2.7 and this is to celebrate the 80k stars on github!\r\n\r\nChangelogs\r\n\r\n- Realtime face enhancer\r\n- Inswapper optimizer\r\n- 2 new face enhancer models (GPEN 512 and GPEN 256)\r\n- Face enhancer Scaler\r\n- Quick lip mask\r\n- Interpolation\r\n- Lip Mask\r\n- Chin Mask\r\n- Eyes Mask\r\n- GPU changer for multi GPU support\r\n- LUT's for easy grading\r\n- Window Projection\r\n- In window preview\r\n- Realtime Video Watching\r\n- Window Projection full screen mode to watch realtime videos\r\n- Camera Refresh\r\n- Resolution Changer\r\n- Better UI\r\n\r\nOh, did I say 27fps with face enhancer on?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddbd9493-9515-47bd-9f97-623efe82963a\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd a lot more! This is the largest update of deeplivecam ever!\r\n[Get the quickstart exclusively at our website!](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/plans?plan_id=0&group_id=0)",
