      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hacksider/Deep-Live-Cam/zipball/2.6",
      "body": "**Version 2.5 was too small for us... Welcome to 2.6!**\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve been working hard behind the scenes and decided that the progress we made deserved more than just a \"point five\" update. We\u2019re officially skipping 2.5 and jumping straight into the 2.6 Power Update!\r\n\r\n**What\u2019s under the hood?**\r\n\r\n- Virtual Camera support is officially here! Hook it up via OBS and go live on any platform with ease.\r\n\r\n- We\u2019ve gutted and rebuilt the core. Rendering is now significantly faster across the board\u2014whether you\u2019re running live, generating images, or processing video. The minified version of this is on the github version as well!\r\n\r\n- Use the new \"Refresh\" button to grab your latest camera feed without the annoying app restart.\r\n\r\n- Various bug fixes and stability tweaks to keep things running cool. This will be the baseline of the future versions so expect it to run smoother than ever!",
