      "body": "**Change Logs \u2013 Big Improvements Ahead!**\r\n\r\n\u2705 Dropdown fixed \u2013 smoother navigation, no more hiccups!\r\n\r\n\u26a1 Forced GPU usage on laptops \u2013 unleash that extra power for faster, sharper performance.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Poisson Blending upgrade \u2013 say goodbye to those translucent boxes on swaps, plus cleaner ears for a more natural look.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc44 Mouthmask adjustment \u2013 now optimized for inswapper, making expressions more seamless than ever.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Other minor tweaks & polish \u2013 because the little details matter too!\r\n\r\n[Exclusively available at our official website!](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/quickstart)\r\n\r\nOh I forgot, the preview on videos and image swapping is now working really fast! This will serve as the base of version 2.5 with realtime preview (watch swapped videos on realtime!)",
