      "body": "2.3d\r\n\r\n- Created another patch for the dropdown as it still affects the users\r\n\r\nif the previous versions don't have any issues on your end, you do not need to download this.\r\n\r\n[Available exclusively on Quickstart](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/quickstart) \r\n\r\n\r\n2.3c\r\n\r\n- Issue on the dropdown fixed\r\n- You only need to download this if you encountered issues on the dropdown which is on model selection and camera selection. I\r\n2.3b\r\n\r\n- Face enhancer fixed\r\n- Mouth mask fixed\r\n- FPS Counter fixed\r\n- No more false positives, just run deep-live-cam.bat\r\n\r\n2.3\r\n\r\n- Smarter Model Selection Discover our brand-new models dropdown\u2014an intuitive way to explore and switch between top-performing models, handpicked through rigorous testing. We also added the HyperSwap model which gives you\r\n- 256x256 faces (200% better face swap!)\r\n- Lightning-Fast Face Enhancer Experience up to 4x faster performance with our upgraded face enhancement engine. Sharper results, less waiting",
