      "body": "DeepLiveCam v2.3 Has Arrived \u2014 and It\u2019s Packed with Upgrades\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re excited to roll out Version 2.3 of DeepLiveCam, bringing powerful enhancements to your [Quickstart](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/quickstart) experience:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0f43421-f29f-4e9f-b813-4ce23f134307\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1564\" height=\"733\" alt=\"2 3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc437a7d-a760-40ba-9917-9330f174f98c\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- Smarter Model Selection Discover our brand-new models dropdown\u2014an intuitive way to explore and switch between top-performing models, handpicked through rigorous testing. We also added the [HyperSwap](https://github.com/facefusion/facefusion-labs) model which gives you 256x256 faces (200% better face swap!)\r\n\r\n- Lightning-Fast Face Enhancer Experience up to 4x faster performance with our upgraded face enhancement engine. Sharper results, less waiting.\r\n\r\nReady to dive in? Download the latest version now\u2014exclusively on our [Quickstart](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/quickstart) page.",
