      "body": "![2025-08-07_19-38-42](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6e2425f-adc7-4092-89fe-602a9ec33e6a)\r\n\r\nExperience a smoother, more natural live streaming look with our latest update. Deep Live Cam 2.2 introduces a sleek new interface and the powerful Forehead Adjustment feature\u2014designed to eliminate awkward hair fading and seamlessly blend your natural hairline into your stream.\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to visual glitches and hello to flawless realism.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f What\u2019s New in 2.2:\r\n\u2728 Forehead Adjustment \u2013 Achieve a more natural hairline with precision blending.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Revamped UI \u2013 Cleaner, faster, and easier to navigate.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Bug Fixes \u2013 Improved stability and performance.\r\n\r\n[Download it from our official website at deeplivecam.net!](https://deeplivecam.net/index.php/quickstart)",
